  "description": "This luxurious apartment at Clancy Quay, Islandbridge, Dublin 8, signals a new style of living for you to enjoy, coming fully furnished with custom designed interiors and exclusive resident amenities. \nWith more reasons to love where you live, Clancy Quay offers you a unique rental experience with inclusive amenities for residents only. Enjoy a state-of-the-art gym, business centre with office pods, games room with pool table, spacious lounge for relaxing, sleek chef-style kitchen and much more.\n\nClancy Quay\n\n-\tUnique features restored from Clancy Barracks\n-\tHigh-quality interior design finish and bespoke furnishings throughout\n-\tGenerous and bright interiors with extensive storage space\n-\tEfficient central heating system with thermostat control\n-\tWired for phone, cable and broadband services\n \nClancy Quay: Local Area & Building\n\n-\tLocated on the historic Clancy Barracks site dating from 1850s \n-\tProfessionally designed and maintained private landscaped courtyards and patios with seating areas \n-\t3 kms from St Stephen's Green (30-minute walk)\n-\t15-minute walk to Heuston Station (Intercity, LUAS and Airlink 747)\n-\tExtensive Dublin Bus service routes\n-\tFast access to the M50 motorway \n-\tMinutes from the Irish Museum of Modern Art and Phoenix Park\n-\tAudio-visual intercom access system\n-\tSecure fob control for resident areas \n-\tContemporary lighting to all exterior walkways, courtyards and patios\n-\tExterior bike cages\n\n\nServices at Clancy Quay include:\n\n-\tState-of-the-art gym\n-\tCinema room for screenings\n-\tBusiness centre with office pods\n-\tGames room with pool table \n-\tChef-style kitchen for events\n-\tSpacious lounge for relaxing\n-\tSecure parking available at additional cost \n-\tViews of the Phoenix Park\n-\t24-hour monitored CCTV\n-\tManagement office on-site\n-\tDedicated property manager\n-\tAfter hours management service\n-\tMail room/package storage services \n-\tOn-site convenience store\n\nTo truly appreciate the uniqueness of this Kennedy Wilson property, viewing is strongly advised.  \n\n***Please note that the above images represent a property of a similar standard***Viewing is highly recommended***",
